{"id":"632784","name":"减脂生菜包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"","cover":"images/632784/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西生菜","amount":"几片"},{"name":"玉米粒","amount":"80g"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"30g"},{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"30g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"小许"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"小许"},{"name":"红椒","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜切丁，西兰花取几朵。","img":"images/632784/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡胸肉切丁，片另外做菜。","img":"images/632784/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"熟玉米取颗粒，放处理好的木耳丁。","img":"images/632784/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切洋葱丁放进来。","img":"images/632784/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把鸡肉和胡萝卜西兰花焯熟。","img":"images/632784/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出洗净浮沫。","img":"images/632784/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"都弄成小丁，放海盐黑胡椒。","img":"images/632784/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"觉得颜色不够美，又切了点红椒丁放进来拌匀。","img":"images/632784/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"西生菜洗净。","img":"images/632784/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取一片，放碗里。","img":"images/632784/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放上玉米鸡肉拌菜即可。","img":"images/632784/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/632784/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"可以每片生菜只包小许玉米鸡肉拌菜，我放一片生菜包里是为了拍照好看。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}